      "message": "fix(post): Tormach PathPilot mill post reads the operation's coolant\n\ntormach.cps now declares coolantModes and reads PARAM Coolant. Off\nwrites no coolant word, so a dry router (Tormach 24R, no coolant list)\nposts an Off operation. Mist, Air and Through tool take the machine's\nown entry of that family, or are refused by name. Flood is unchanged.\n\nFixes #3446\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
